###

<!-- rtdf-block-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_club_bingo:b0003; role: provision; provision-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_club_bingo:p0001; source-lines: 1-1; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala-metadata
```

(4) Club bingo Club bingo is a permitted gaming activity for the purposes of section 10 of the Act if the following requirements are complied with—

    (a)  it is conducted by or on the authority of a registered club on the registered club premises for the purpose of attracting patronage to the club’s facilities,

<!-- rtdf-block-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_club_bingo:b0004; role: provision; provision-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_club_bingo:p0002; source-lines: 2-4; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
```

    (b)  except as provided by paragraph (c), the total value of all of the available prizes for 1 game of the gaming activity does not exceed $70,


<!-- rtdf-block-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_club_bingo:b0005; role: provision; provision-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_club_bingo:p0003; source-lines: 5-5; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
```


(c)  if a bonus prize is offered at the end of a session of club bingo, only 1 prize of a value not exceeding $70 may be offered,

<!-- rtdf-block-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_club_bingo:b0006; role: provision; provision-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_club_bingo:p0004; source-lines: 8-8; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
```


(d)  none of the prizes consist of or include money.

<!-- rtdf-block-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_club_bingo:b0007; role: provision; provision-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_club_bingo:p0005; source-lines: 10-10; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
```

